{"availability":"available","full":"sametkabay/agent-arena","name":"agent-arena","description":"Browser-native multi-agent playground: drop LLM personas on a 3D map, watch them live, and talk to them. OpenAI, Gemini, Claude, Ollama. No backend.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":14,"forks":2,"created":"2026-08-06T13:56:53Z","updated":"2026-10-06T14:17:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/","topics":["3d","agent-simulation","anthropic","gemini","github-pages","llm-agents","multi-agent","ollama","openai","playground","react-three-fiber","simulation","threejs","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:51.982Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:51.982Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:51.982Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T07:22:10.134Z","stars":13,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:48.393Z","stars":13,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:12:42.664Z","stars":13,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-16T23:49:47.186Z","stars":14,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-19T00:45:51.982Z","stars":14,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Agent Arena is an open-source, browser-native multi-agent playground. You place LLM-powered characters on a 3D map (office, forest, or space), watch them idle-talk, and chat with them privately or in a shared arena. It runs entirely in the browser with OpenAI, Gemini, Claude, or Ollama — no Agent Arena backend.","[]( [](./LICENSE) [](./public/assets/ATTRIBUTION.md) []( [](","Early preview (v0.1.0) — map format and UI may still change."],"features":["Drop LLM-powered characters onto an office floor, a forest camp, or a night-lit planetary outpost","Chat one-on-one, broadcast in a shared arena feed, or @mention a single agent","Idle mutters appear as speech bubbles — the world keeps living when you are not typing","Tune personas, maps,